<title>USA: Slinger, Wis., $2.170 won by Griffin, Kubik.</title>
<headline>Slinger, Wis., $2.170 won by Griffin, Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $2.170 million of Slinger Wis., water and electric system revenue bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
